              "html": "<i>Use</i> the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Raw_salmon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">raw salmon</a> on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Range\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">range</a> in Gertrude&#39;s house to make a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Gently_smoked_salmon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">gently smoked salmon</a>.",
